    "metadata": {
      "title": "Policy as versioned code \u2014 served Kyverno control evidence",
      "last-modified": "2026-10-03T00:00:00Z",
      "version": "1.1.0",
      "oscal-version": "1.1.2",
      "remarks": "C2P component-definition: maps each served Kyverno policy (the Check_Id result2oscal string-matches against PolicyReport results[].policy, version suffix stripped) to its primary NIST 800-53r5 control. Each Check_Id occurs once because this converter emits one control per check. A mapping does not imply that mutation or generation necessarily produces a PolicyReport result; the up-flow records only results actually observed."
    },
